OL,3,GNEWSACouncil homes to be built after
OL,4,Aethics concerns
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe replacement for a city centre
OL,7,Fcouncil estate due to be demolished
OL,8,Fwill include social housing after
OL,9,Fgovernment funding was confirmed.
OL,11,FHanover Court and Princess Court, off
OL,12,FHills Road in Cambridge - said by
OL,13,Fdevelopers to be in poor condition, too
OL,14,Fsmall and unable to meet fire safety
OL,15,Fstandards - will be knocked down.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,375,370,200,160,0,100
