OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSACouncil homes to be built after
OL,4,Aethics concerns
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen planning approval was given, there
OL,7,Fwas no guarantee council homes would be
OL,8,Fbuilt - raising questions about the
OL,9,F"ethics" - but Cambridge City Council
OL,10,Fhas received funding from Homes England
OL,11,Fto build 72 council homes as part of
OL,12,Fthe 165-flat development.
OL,14,FBen Binns, assistant director of
OL,15,Fdevelopment at the council, said the
OL,16,Fauthority was "delighted" with the
OL,17,Ffunding.
